## Head to Head — Matchup Generation

Matchups generated by commissioner (or auto) at season start:

```javascript
// Weekly matchup generation algorithm
function generateMatchups(members, week) {
  // Round-robin scheduling
  // Ensures each team plays every other team once before repeating
  // With divisions: division games weighted (play division 2x, others 1x)
  const schedule = roundRobin(members, week);
  return schedule.map(([home, away]) => ({
    matchupId: `${home}_${away}`,
    week, home, away,
    homeScore: 0, awayScore: 0, result: null
  }));
}
```

Matchup results auto-written by GitHub Actions auto-scorer alongside scores.

