## Concurrent Guillotine Logic

When `guillotine: true` on a league:

1. After each week scores finalize (Tuesday 9am):
   - Find lowest scorer among non-eliminated members
   - Write their uid to `/leagues/{id}/season/{year}/meta/guillotineEliminated`
   - Set `/leagues/{id}/members/{uid}/eliminated: true`
2. Eliminated players:
   - Can still submit lineups (for fun / side bets)
   - Scores shown with ☠️ badge
   - Not counted in guillotine standings
3. Last survivor wins guillotine prize (separate from main format winner)

