## Client-Side League Context

Every page that loads needs to know which league it's operating in:

```javascript
// Stored in localStorage after login / league selection
const leagueContext = {
  leagueId:   'fr_refresh26',
  leagueName: 'Fantasy Refresh 2026',
  season:     2026,
  format:     'cumulative',
  guillotine: false,
  role:       'commissioner',   // member | commissioner
  teamName:   'My Team Name'
};

// All Firebase paths built from context
const LEAGUE_PATH = `/leagues/${leagueContext.leagueId}`;
const SEASON_PATH = `${LEAGUE_PATH}/season/${leagueContext.season}`;
const LINEUP_PATH = `${LEAGUE_PATH}/lineups/${leagueContext.season}`;
```

