## Migration Script (runs once)

Copies existing 2026 data to new paths without deleting old paths.
Old paths stay as backup until end of season.

Steps:
1. Create `/leagues/fr_refresh26/settings`
2. Copy `/playerPool2026` → `/playerPool/2026`
3. Copy `/users2026/{uid}` → `/users/{uid}` (merge)
4. Copy `/season2026` → `/leagues/fr_refresh26/season/2026`
5. Copy `/lineups2026` → `/leagues/fr_refresh26/lineups/2026`
6. Copy `/salaries2026` → `/leagues/fr_refresh26/salaries/2026`
7. Copy `/locks2026` → `/leagues/fr_refresh26/locks/2026`
8. Copy `/teamNames2026` → `/leagues/fr_refresh26/members`
9. Copy `/reactions2026` → `/leagues/fr_refresh26/reactions/2026`
10. Update app to read from new paths
11. Verify — keep old paths until Week 1

